# Arena Neon Kick Deployable

A deployable version of the **Arena Neon Kick** project. This repository contains the necessary files to run, modify, and deploy the application.

## Features

- Lightweight and portable
- Easy deployment-ready structure
- Modern neon UI/UX
- Works out-of-the-box (no additional dependencies)

